{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1794547753411142002,"compiled_state":{"alias":"appealing-driveable-ass","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"1f5757f95dbc6391edb9ed59d853baf1e442b65ee255d5f56149956de9c981bf","event_uuid":"c6edfec9-92b5-4372-9d87-cd9dc30ff706","position":{"commit_sha":"b753a4fb156c837f40b9301ed271a628abef71a7","position":"1794547697775543001-c6edfec9-92b5-4372-9d87-cd9dc30ff706"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"},{"content_hash":"05fd515784c95e2d9f3dff5366d10263286df799df99df27aac40b0c255041e0","event_uuid":"2603c90a-ba15-43e2-838d-86e22d647e3e","position":{"commit_sha":"798ab29385123624eef5d935422faf73feb816ee","position":"1794547753411142001-2603c90a-ba15-43e2-838d-86e22d647e3e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1794547697775543001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"2603c90a-ba15-43e2-838d-86e22d647e3e","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"9794-4336-5ed6-4561"}],"description":"## Problem\n`_run_plan_review` (`src/rebar/llm/plan_review/__init__.py`, about line 625) runs `_apply_review_floors` only when `engine == \"pipeline\"`. Under the agentic engine, these steps are skipped:\n- the Pass-3 rising floor;\n- the completion floor;\n- the drift floor (`drift_floor.maybe_apply`, which can downgrade BLOCK to PASS through `_recompute_verdict_after_drop`);\n- the consistency cross-checks (`xcheck.maybe_apply_contradiction` and `maybe_apply_comment_trail`, which rewrite `verdict[\"blocking\"]`);\n- fix-unit grouping.\n\nSo for the same plan material and findings, the two engines can sign different verdict strings and blocking lists.\n\nThe code comment cites ADR 0123, but `docs/adr/0123-selectable-plan-review-engine.md` documents only the Layer-1 floor and claimability running first under both engines. It does not say that the post-dispatch tail is pipeline-only, or that the drift floor's convergence (a code-drift re-review of an unchanged plan converging back to PASS) does not apply to agentic reviews.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Either the tail steps that change the verdict string or the `blocking` list (the drift floor and the cross-checks) also run on agentic verdicts, or ADR 0123 is amended to state and justify that they are pipeline-only.\n- [ ] A test pins the chosen behavior under both engines.\n- [ ] `make verify` exits 0.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"5bd7-33ec-8630-440e","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Agentic verdicts skip drift floor and cross-checks","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["c6edfec9-92b5-4372-9d87-cd9dc30ff706","2603c90a-ba15-43e2-838d-86e22d647e3e"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794547753411142002,"uuid":"bb62ea18-b8c6-4e2f-8bec-865ef82ed3b0"}